  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section style="background:#F5E6D8;padding:88px 28px;">
    <div style="max-width:880px;margin:0 auto;">
      <div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:52px;">
        <div style="font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C9653F;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:14px;">Questions, answered</div>
        <h2 style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:40px;margin:0 0 14px;color:#6B3D42;">The honest answers</h2>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#4a3a30;max-width:48ch;margin:0 auto;">No spin, no over-promising. If something isn't here, our team reads every message.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="border-top:1px solid rgba(107,61,66,0.2);">
        <!-- 1 -->
        <div style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(107,61,66,0.2);">
          <button data-wk-faq="1" style="width:100%;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;background:none;border:none;text-align:left;padding:24px 0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;">
            <span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:21px;color:#6B3D42;line-height:1.3;">I'm not sure I'm in perimenopause yet — is this for me?</span>
            <span style="font-size:22px;color:#C9653F;font-weight:300;flex:0 0 auto;">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="wk-panel" data-wk-faq-panel="1" style="display:block;">
            <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#4a3a30;margin:0 0 24px;max-width:66ch;">Most likely, yes. Perimenopause can begin in your early forties — often years before the word menopause feels like it belongs to you. If you're noticing changes in sleep, mood, bloating, or temperature and a doctor has told you your labs are "normal," this formula was built for exactly that window.*</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- 2 -->
        <div style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(107,61,66,0.2);">
          <button data-wk-faq="2" style="width:100%;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;background:none;border:none;text-align:left;padding:24px 0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;">
            <span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:21px;color:#6B3D42;line-height:1.3;">Does it contain hormones?</span>
            <span style="font-size:22px;color:#C9653F;font-weight:300;flex:0 0 auto;">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="wk-panel" data-wk-faq-panel="2" style="display:none;">
            <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#4a3a30;margin:0 0 24px;max-width:66ch;">No. There is no estrogen, progesterone, or any hormone in this formula. It works through named botanicals, vitamins, and a probiotic blend that support your body's own systems — including the estrobolome — rather than adding hormones to them.*</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- 3 -->
        <div style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(107,61,66,0.2);">
          <button data-wk-faq="3" style="width:100%;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;background:none;border:none;text-align:left;padding:24px 0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;">
            <span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:21px;color:#6B3D42;line-height:1.3;">How is this different from a multivitamin or other menopause supplements?</span>
            <span style="font-size:22px;color:#C9653F;font-weight:300;flex:0 0 auto;">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="wk-panel" data-wk-faq-panel="3" style="display:none;">
            <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#4a3a30;margin:0 0 24px;max-width:66ch;">Most of the category hides behind proprietary blends and fairy-dust doses. We name and dose every active at the level the research actually used — 200mg ashwagandha, 100mg standardised black cohosh, 100mg red clover isoflavones, and a 10 billion CFU probiotic blend. You can read exactly what you're taking, and how much, on the panel.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- 9: how to take -->
        <div style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(107,61,66,0.2);">
          <button data-wk-faq="9" style="width:100%;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;background:none;border:none;text-align:left;padding:24px 0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;">
            <span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:21px;color:#6B3D42;line-height:1.3;">How do I take it?</span>
            <span style="font-size:22px;color:#C9653F;font-weight:300;flex:0 0 auto;">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="wk-panel" data-wk-faq-panel="9" style="display:none;">
            <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#4a3a30;margin:0 0 24px;max-width:66ch;">Two gummies daily, with or without food, at a time you'll remember — there's no loading phase and no routine to build your day around. Consistency matters more than timing, so pick a moment that sticks. Each bottle is 60 gummies, a full 30-day supply at the two-a-day serving.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- 4 -->
        <div style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(107,61,66,0.2);">
          <button data-wk-faq="4" style="width:100%;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;background:none;border:none;text-align:left;padding:24px 0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;">
            <span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:21px;color:#6B3D42;line-height:1.3;">When will I notice a difference?</span>
            <span style="font-size:22px;color:#C9653F;font-weight:300;flex:0 0 auto;">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="wk-panel" data-wk-faq-panel="4" style="display:none;">
            <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#4a3a30;margin:0 0 24px;max-width:66ch;">Many women report steadier sleep and a calmer stress response within two to three weeks. Bloating and mood often follow by week four, with the fuller picture — cooler nights, steadier days — by weeks six to eight as the actives reach steady state. Consistency matters more than timing.*</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- 5 -->
        <div style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(107,61,66,0.2);">
          <button data-wk-faq="5" style="width:100%;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;background:none;border:none;text-align:left;padding:24px 0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;">
            <span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:21px;color:#6B3D42;line-height:1.3;">Can I take it alongside my medications or other supplements?</span>
            <span style="font-size:22px;color:#C9653F;font-weight:300;flex:0 0 auto;">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="wk-panel" data-wk-faq-panel="5" style="display:none;">
            <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#4a3a30;margin:0 0 24px;max-width:66ch;">Because every ingredient and dose is on the label, you and your clinician can review it in full. Some botanicals — black cohosh and chasteberry among them — can interact with certain medications or conditions, so please check with your healthcare provider before starting, especially if you are taking medication, are pregnant, or are nursing.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- 6 -->
        <div style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(107,61,66,0.2);">
          <button data-wk-faq="6" style="width:100%;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;background:none;border:none;text-align:left;padding:24px 0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;">
            <span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:21px;color:#6B3D42;line-height:1.3;">Is it really sugar-free — and what does it taste like?</span>
            <span style="font-size:22px;color:#C9653F;font-weight:300;flex:0 0 auto;">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="wk-panel" data-wk-faq-panel="6" style="display:none;">
            <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#4a3a30;margin:0 0 24px;max-width:66ch;">Yes — no added sugar and no sugar alcohols that upset the gut. The gummy is a deep-red cranberry, lightly tart rather than candy-sweet, designed to be a daily you actually look forward to without working against the formula's gut support.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- 7 -->
        <div style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(107,61,66,0.2);">
          <button data-wk-faq="7" style="width:100%;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;background:none;border:none;text-align:left;padding:24px 0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;">
            <span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:21px;color:#6B3D42;line-height:1.3;">What is the estrobolome, and why does it matter?</span>
            <span style="font-size:22px;color:#C9653F;font-weight:300;flex:0 0 auto;">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="wk-panel" data-wk-faq-panel="7" style="display:none;">
            <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#4a3a30;margin:0 0 24px;max-width:66ch;">It's the community of gut bacteria that helps metabolise estrogen. When it falls out of balance — as it often does in the transition — recirculating estrogen can swing, feeding bloating, mood shifts, and disrupted sleep. Our probiotic blend supports that gut–hormone conversation, so the rest of the formula has steadier ground to work on.*</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- 8 -->
        <div style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(107,61,66,0.2);">
          <button data-wk-faq="8" style="width:100%;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;background:none;border:none;text-align:left;padding:24px 0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;">
            <span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:21px;color:#6B3D42;line-height:1.3;">How does the subscription work, and what if it's not for me?</span>
            <span style="font-size:22px;color:#C9653F;font-weight:300;flex:0 0 auto;">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="wk-panel" data-wk-faq-panel="8" style="display:none;">
            <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#4a3a30;margin:0 0 24px;max-width:66ch;">Your subscription ships free on your chosen cadence, and you can pause, skip, or cancel anytime from your account — no emails, no hoops. And because the formula needs a full transition cycle to show what it can do, every order is backed by our 90-day money-back guarantee: take the whole three months, and if it isn't right for you, reach out for a full refund — no need to return the bottles.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:44px;">
        <p style="font-size:14px;color:#7a6258;margin:0 0 20px;">Still wondering about something?</p>
